 Scout + Play Now

Set your first lineup 

Show off your managerial skills by picking your lineup. Choose your starting 5 based on player form, team fit, and lineup considerations. The choice is yours – you fully own your team – and the stage is set for you to make your mark on the leaderboards against friends and rivals.

Scout the Marketplace

The Premier League offers plenty of talent: Explore the Sorare Marketplace to scout, buy, sell, and trade digital player cards. The Marketplace is a great tool to analyze player stats, track performance, and, ultimately, secure the stars who will shine on the pitch.

Play with your Friends

For every friend you invite who collects five cards from the Primary Market, both you and your friend win a Tier-3 Limited Card. The more friends you invite, the better the card you are rewarded!

